  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Mia is at Lily's house. They play an animal game. They have fun. \"I am a big bear,\" says Mia. Her body is big and brown. \"Look at my big arms!\" says Mia. \"Now I am a bat,\" says Lily. She opens her arms and runs. \"Look at me, Mia!\" \"You are a good bat!\" says Mia.",
      "Pip comes to the room. He sees the big bear. \"Woof! Woof!\" says Pip. Mia stops. Pip runs behind the sofa. He looks at Mia with big eyes. \"Is Pip sad?\" asks Lily. \"Pip, it is me,\" says Mia. \"It is a game!\"",
      "Mia sits on the floor. \"Come here, Pip,\" she says. Pip looks at her face. Then he comes to her. Mia says, \"Sorry, Pip.\" She holds his small head. \"Woof!\" says Pip. Pip is happy now. Lily smiles. \"Is Pip a bear?\" asks Lily. \"No, Pip is a dog!\" says Mia."
    ],
